      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-02-2020-october/q6",
      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\"><li>Given that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2+8x-3}{x+2}\\equiv Ax+B+\\frac{C}{x+2}\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\\quad x\\neq -2\" data-display=\"true\"></div>find the values of the constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Hence, using algebraic integration, find the exact value of<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int_0^6\\frac{x^2+8x-3}{x+2}\\,\\mathrm dx\" data-display=\"true\"></div>giving your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a+b\\ln 2\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are integers to be found. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
