      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Show that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos 3A\\equiv 4\\cos^3 A-3\\cos A\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence solve, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-90^\\circ\\leqslant x\\leqslant 180^\\circ\"></span>, the equation<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1-\\cos 3x=\\sin^2 x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
